Hello everyone, we are Jiushi Society. Our game was launched for the first time, but due to lack of relevant experience, there were some issues on the release date. We have received a lot of feedback from players and friends about 'Moon White Star Fight' today, and our production team would like to express our sincere gratitude for this. In addition to some suggestions for game optimization, we also discovered some bugs in the game. The production team attaches great importance to the information received and has adjusted the relevant work plan accordingly.

The main types of problems are as follows:

[b] Question 1: [/b] Issues that affect gaming and visual effects. The problems include inability to advance some personal character lines, abnormal game main interface, loss of music, loss of facial expressions, overlapping vertical drawings, etc. These issues will be urgently fixed and updated by the production team before July 22nd (Monday).

[b] Question 2: [/b] Optimize the gaming experience. The optimization content includes font adaptation issues in games, optimization of English translation arrangement, addition of shortcut keys, and so on.

At present, this type of experience optimization suggestion is open for collection. Welcome to join the group (QQ group: [u] 545909596 [/u]) to provide feedback to the production team's operations team or to the Bilibili official account via private message.

We expect to optimize and update this type of issue before August.

Due to being the first game to be produced and released, there is a lack of experience in the production team. But we will carefully optimize all game issues and live up to expectations.

We will first focus on fixing the most important issues to ensure that everyone receives the most basic gaming experience in the shortest possible time. We are currently facing a tight manpower situation and can only choose the most important ones to fix first. However, we will definitely fix the feedback issues. Please trust us.

We will not give up on our first game, nor will we give up on all players. We will work hard to repair this game and give it the gaming experience it deserves.

We will definitely do our game well, please give us a chance.

